bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Admin Policy Edit UI" as UI
boundary Router
control PoliciesController
control AccessTokenGuard
control RolesGuard
control PoliciesService
entity ":PoliciesModel" as PoliciesModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Open policy page
activate Admin
activate UI


UI -> Router: 2. GET /policies/{id}
activate Router

Router -> PoliciesController: 3. findById(id)
activate PoliciesController

PoliciesController -> PoliciesService: 4. findById(id)
activate PoliciesService

PoliciesService -> PoliciesModel: 5. findById(id)
activate PoliciesModel

PoliciesModel -> MongoDB: 6. query by _id
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> PoliciesModel: 7. policy
deactivate MongoDB

PoliciesModel --> PoliciesService: 8. policy
deactivate PoliciesModel

PoliciesService -> PoliciesService: 9. Check policy
activate PoliciesService
space
deactivate PoliciesService

opt Not found
  PoliciesService --> PoliciesController: 9.1. Throw NotFoundException
  PoliciesController --> Router: 9.2. HTTP 404
  Router --> UI: 9.3. Load failed
  UI --> Admin: 9.4. Show error message
end

PoliciesService --> PoliciesController: 10. policy
deactivate PoliciesService

PoliciesController --> Router: 11. HTTP 200 response
deactivate PoliciesController

Router --> UI: 12. Return policy
deactivate Router
UI --> Admin: 13. Display policy data
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin